{
  "_note": "TEMPLATE \u2014 copy to config/screening_answers.json and fill in YOUR truthful answers. screening_answers.json is gitignored because it contains personal data (salary, EEO, authorization). If no high-confidence match exists, the system PAUSES and asks the user. Never answer 'no sponsorship required' unless it is true. All answers must be truthful.",
